WEBVTT

01:41.780 --> 01:48.860
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.250 --> 01:51.850
[Episode 11]

01:55.000 --> 01:55.920
What's this?

01:56.150 --> 01:57.880
It's a semi-automatic guitar.

01:58.070 --> 02:00.310
Just press the corresponding keys
and it'll play the chords.

02:00.310 --> 02:01.120
Give it a try.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.230
That's so cool.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.760
Let me try.

02:15.080 --> 02:16.910
My fingers are so sensitive.
Don't even mention pressing down

02:16.910 --> 02:20.170
on the strings—
just lightly touching one hurts like hell.

02:22.360 --> 02:24.560
These fingers are pretty much done for.

02:26.710 --> 02:28.170
I brought some band-aids.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.520
Give me your hand.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.440
Let me do it instead.

02:55.120 --> 02:55.970
Does it hurt?

02:56.910 --> 02:57.910
Be gentle.

03:10.460 --> 03:12.580
Can we really count on Duan Qiyan?

03:13.530 --> 03:14.790
We'll have to go for it.

03:17.090 --> 03:19.210
It's all or nothing then.

03:20.579 --> 03:21.370
Let's do it.

04:47.570 --> 04:50.300
Baihui, are the monthly exam results
not out yet?

04:51.390 --> 04:54.540
[Daily Study Plan]

04:51.980 --> 04:54.130
My colleague Zhang's son is also
in No. 1 High School.

04:54.130 --> 04:56.330
He said the results came out
a long time ago.

04:56.330 --> 04:57.130
They're out.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.250
I didn't do very well this time,

05:00.250 --> 05:01.650
so I didn't tell you guys.

05:03.190 --> 05:04.390
What rank did you get?

05:05.860 --> 05:06.660
I got...

05:07.930 --> 05:08.740
Fifth.

05:09.250 --> 05:10.220
Fifth?

05:17.150 --> 05:19.720
[Daily Study Plan]

05:21.540 --> 05:22.330
What's this?

05:23.770 --> 05:24.620
Lyrics.

05:24.690 --> 05:26.370
You got fifth place and you still
have time for this kind of stuff?

05:26.370 --> 05:29.770
- No, this is my...
- Does this have anything to do with studying?

05:29.770 --> 05:31.370
Are you spending all day at school

05:31.370 --> 05:33.060
thinking about these pointless things?

05:33.060 --> 05:34.100
No, I just...

05:34.100 --> 05:35.360
Don't bother arguing.

05:35.510 --> 05:36.810
I'll go talk to
your homeroom teacher tomorrow

05:36.810 --> 05:38.450
and find out what's really going on.

05:38.450 --> 05:39.220
Tomo...

05:39.690 --> 05:40.330
Dad!

05:50.230 --> 05:55.690
[Celebrating the Anniversary
of Nanhai No. 1 High School]

05:59.060 --> 05:59.860
Ms. Kong.

06:00.370 --> 06:02.220
Jin Baihui's grades

06:02.220 --> 06:04.050
have dropped way too much this time.

06:04.050 --> 06:06.220
We're having a hard time accepting it.

06:07.930 --> 06:09.770
Fluctuations in grades are normal.

06:09.770 --> 06:10.500
We don't need to

06:10.500 --> 06:12.540
let a single set of results get to us.

06:13.130 --> 06:14.370
Besides, I don't think

06:14.370 --> 06:17.030
the drop is necessarily
as serious as you think.

06:17.120 --> 06:17.770
Well...

06:19.010 --> 06:20.420
A drop is a drop.

06:20.420 --> 06:22.820
Does it matter
whether it's serious or not?

06:23.330 --> 06:25.010
That's because the pace in high school
is different from

06:25.010 --> 06:25.870
middle school.

06:26.010 --> 06:27.180
Exams are just a way

06:27.370 --> 06:28.540
for us to assess students' proficiency

06:28.540 --> 06:29.860
at this stage.

06:31.930 --> 06:34.570
Jin Baihui is different from
other students.

06:34.860 --> 06:36.300
She came back from Beijing,

06:36.300 --> 06:37.690
s-so she should have adapted to

06:37.690 --> 06:40.100
this pace a year earlier than
most students.

06:40.100 --> 06:41.220
Yes, that's right.

06:43.770 --> 06:45.370
I understand how you both feel.

06:45.370 --> 06:48.060
I'll also keep a close eye
on my students' progress

06:48.060 --> 06:49.659
from the teaching side.

06:50.010 --> 06:52.100
But at the same time, I hope parents

06:52.250 --> 06:53.250
can maintain

06:53.770 --> 06:55.100
a more relaxed mindset.

06:55.250 --> 06:56.620
Once an exam is over, it's over.

06:56.620 --> 06:58.080
We still have the next one.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.130
Besides, I think Jin Baihui

06:59.130 --> 07:00.770
is a well-rounded student.

07:01.220 --> 07:03.550
I think you should have confidence in her.

07:05.570 --> 07:06.420
By the way, there's the school anniversary

07:06.420 --> 07:08.860
celebration this afternoon,
with performances.

07:08.860 --> 07:10.660
She'll be going on stage as well.

07:15.220 --> 07:16.620
She'll be going on stage?

07:19.570 --> 07:20.970
She's the lead vocalist.

07:21.010 --> 07:22.620
The song their band will be performing

07:22.620 --> 07:23.890
was written by her.

07:24.100 --> 07:26.630
I heard them rehearse.
They were really good.

07:53.250 --> 07:54.909
Those lyrics from yesterday—

07:55.300 --> 07:57.360
you wrote them yourself, didn't you?

07:58.590 --> 08:00.920
And you're even going to perform
on stage?

08:01.180 --> 08:03.980
How could you keep
such an important thing from us?

08:05.860 --> 08:07.520
Writing songs and rehearsing

08:07.540 --> 08:09.860
must have taken up
so much of your study time.

08:09.860 --> 08:11.060
Your grades have ended up like this

08:11.060 --> 08:12.930
because you've been putting your heart

08:12.930 --> 08:14.590
into these pointless things.

08:16.540 --> 08:18.870
Who cares about some school performance?

08:19.060 --> 08:22.460
Will it get you any extra points
on the college entrance exam?

08:23.540 --> 08:26.010
- Dad, I...
- Baihui.

08:26.660 --> 08:27.770
Your dad is right.

08:29.250 --> 08:32.010
What's the point of taking part in
some school performance?

08:32.010 --> 08:33.820
You only have so much time and energy.

08:33.820 --> 08:35.220
If you waste it on things like this,

08:35.220 --> 08:37.020
of course your grades will drop.

08:38.130 --> 08:40.100
How many times do I have to tell you?

08:40.130 --> 08:42.700
These little moments of happiness
you're chasing now

08:42.700 --> 08:45.560
will only become obstacles
on your path to success.

08:46.050 --> 08:46.740
You'd be better off spending that time

08:46.740 --> 08:48.740
doing a couple more practice tests.

08:54.770 --> 08:55.580
Be good

08:56.220 --> 08:57.550
and go tell your teacher

08:57.650 --> 08:59.510
that you won't be participating.

09:00.580 --> 09:02.860
Mom, this performance isn't just about me.

09:02.860 --> 09:04.820
It's the hard work of
many other classmates, too.

09:04.820 --> 09:05.620
If I don't participate,

09:05.620 --> 09:06.890
it'll affect them all.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.410
How am I supposed to
get along with them then?

09:08.410 --> 09:09.220
Get along?

09:10.170 --> 09:11.700
You don't need to get along with them.

09:11.700 --> 09:13.700
You only need to come in first place.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.370
I know it's hard for you now,

09:17.820 --> 09:21.220
but sometimes you have to feel this pain
to learn your lesson.

09:21.410 --> 09:22.130
Mom.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.770
About the school anniversary
this afternoon,

09:23.770 --> 09:25.650
go explain the situation
to your teacher yourself.

09:25.650 --> 09:26.980
Don't let us down again.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.410
Have you decided

09:28.410 --> 09:30.050
which ending pose you'll use?

09:30.050 --> 09:31.290
As long as it looks cool.

09:31.290 --> 09:32.330
That's for sure.

09:33.170 --> 09:33.830
Jin Baihui.

09:37.480 --> 09:39.140
T-These must be your parents.

09:40.250 --> 09:42.110
Nice to meet you, Mr. and Mrs. Jin.

09:42.170 --> 09:43.820
Come and watch our performance
this afternoon.

09:43.820 --> 09:45.480
Jin Baihui sings really well.

09:46.650 --> 09:49.340
So you guys are in a band together, right?

09:50.170 --> 09:51.100
Yes...

09:51.370 --> 09:52.650
Let me tell you,

09:53.170 --> 09:54.130
my daughter Jin Baihui

09:54.130 --> 09:55.460
isn't interested in these things.

09:55.460 --> 09:56.530
- Dad.
- In the future,

09:56.530 --> 09:59.190
don't involve her in these activities
anymore.

10:21.320 --> 10:24.740
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

10:28.740 --> 10:29.600
What happened?

10:32.840 --> 10:33.640
What's wrong?

10:43.990 --> 10:45.620
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

10:56.340 --> 10:57.870
Lin Zhixia, Tang Tingting.

10:58.260 --> 10:59.260
Come out for a bit.

11:17.820 --> 11:20.480
Jin Baihui won't be performing
this afternoon.

11:20.820 --> 11:21.620
Why?

11:24.130 --> 11:25.100
Something came up.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.900
I won't go into details with you.

11:27.500 --> 11:28.410
If she's unable to perform,

11:28.410 --> 11:30.810
is there anyone else
who can take her place?

11:35.250 --> 11:37.110
Her throat hasn't recovered yet.

11:38.700 --> 11:40.630
If there's no one to take her place,

11:41.940 --> 11:44.600
the school may have to
cancel this performance.

11:48.740 --> 11:49.940
Ms. Kong, I can sing.

11:50.130 --> 11:51.740
Please don't cancel our performance.

11:51.740 --> 11:52.530
Are you sure?

11:55.740 --> 11:56.460
Alright then.

11:56.460 --> 11:57.770
I'll try to help you.

11:58.170 --> 11:59.820
But you have to be prepared.

12:06.050 --> 12:07.500
Is our performance going through
some kind of ordeal?

12:07.500 --> 12:09.100
Do we have to face 81 trials?

12:09.120 --> 12:10.150
Am I Tang Sanzang or something?

12:10.150 --> 12:11.180
Save your voice.

12:19.500 --> 12:24.360
[Reading Corner]

12:24.380 --> 12:25.640
What could I say?

12:26.360 --> 12:29.590
[Reading Corner]

12:32.700 --> 12:34.360
It's about Jin Baihui, right?

12:35.770 --> 12:37.740
We just ran into her parents.

12:38.220 --> 12:40.150
I thought my dad was fierce enough,

12:40.740 --> 12:43.670
but Jin Baihui's parents were both
on another level.

12:44.010 --> 12:45.580
What's wrong with her parents?

12:45.580 --> 12:47.860
Her parents wouldn't let her
perform this afternoon,

12:47.860 --> 12:50.320
saying it would distract her
from studying.

12:50.820 --> 12:52.130
I guess to them,

12:52.410 --> 12:54.070
anything other than studying

12:54.220 --> 12:55.750
is considered rebellious.

12:57.170 --> 13:00.220
S-Should we encourage her to be
a little rebellious this time?

13:00.220 --> 13:02.060
My voice still isn't back to normal,

13:02.060 --> 13:04.320
and this song was written by Jin Baihui.

13:04.320 --> 13:05.700
I haven't practiced it enough,

13:05.700 --> 13:07.830
so I really don't have the confidence.

13:08.370 --> 13:09.220
Forget it.

13:09.890 --> 13:11.980
You guys didn't see the way
Jin Baihui's dad

13:11.980 --> 13:14.530
shoved this program sheet at me.

13:16.580 --> 13:19.130
I feel like if she goes against them
and performs,

13:19.130 --> 13:21.330
her parents might actually beat her up.

13:26.050 --> 13:26.700
Tingting.

13:26.980 --> 13:28.500
Take some throat lozenges right away

13:28.500 --> 13:30.980
and try to get your voice in better shape
before you go on stage.

13:30.980 --> 13:32.580
You'll be able to pull it off.

13:45.370 --> 13:46.740
Distinguished leaders,

13:46.740 --> 13:47.700
honored guests,

13:47.740 --> 13:49.890
dear teachers and students,

13:50.010 --> 13:51.500
I hereby declare

13:51.530 --> 13:54.740
the 50th Anniversary Celebration
of Nanhai Province No. 1 High School

13:54.740 --> 13:55.770
officially open.

14:02.620 --> 14:03.940
Up next is a performance

14:03.940 --> 14:07.050
brought to you by Class 4, Grade 10
—a flute solo of "La Traviata."

14:07.050 --> 14:08.290
Please enjoy.

14:08.900 --> 14:11.800
[United in Glory,
Building a Brilliant Campus Together]

15:02.840 --> 15:09.780
♪ The evening breeze rustles the willows
as the flute's melody fades ♪

15:09.810 --> 15:15.590
♪ The setting sun sets
beyond the mountains ♪

15:38.260 --> 15:40.380
[Notice Board]

15:42.390 --> 15:43.650
Are you really willing

15:44.220 --> 15:45.620
to give up just like that?

15:51.410 --> 15:53.210
This song is your original work.

15:53.340 --> 15:55.870
No one else can bring it to life
the way you can.

15:57.940 --> 15:59.010
There are so many performances
at the anniversary celebration.

15:59.010 --> 16:00.580
It won't matter if there's one less,
right?

16:00.580 --> 16:02.370
We've been rehearsing together
for so long.

16:02.370 --> 16:04.230
How can you just give up like that?

16:08.100 --> 16:09.010
My parents asked me

16:09.010 --> 16:11.740
to finish these 3 practice tests
this afternoon.

16:24.460 --> 16:25.990
Have you ever thought about

16:26.580 --> 16:27.440
taking a break?

16:39.050 --> 16:40.340
Next, please enjoy

16:40.340 --> 16:41.770
the classical dance performed by
the students of Class 2, Grade 10,

16:41.770 --> 16:44.370
"Ode to the Orchid Pavilion."

17:11.089 --> 17:12.480
Bravo!

17:28.980 --> 17:29.940
Come on, guys.

17:30.150 --> 17:32.480
We have no choice but to go for it.
Let's go!

17:35.960 --> 17:37.070
Up next

17:37.180 --> 17:39.140
is a song performed by Class 1, Grade 10.

17:39.140 --> 17:40.610
This one is truly amazing.

17:41.050 --> 17:43.520
The band is made up of members
from the first- and second-place teams

17:43.520 --> 17:45.180
in the previous math contest.

17:45.590 --> 17:47.110
Are you excited to see them?

17:47.110 --> 17:48.480
Yes!

17:48.720 --> 17:50.750
Next, please enjoy "Closed Loop."

17:58.320 --> 18:01.730
[United in Glory,
Building a Brilliant Campus Together]

18:01.760 --> 18:04.910
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

18:17.320 --> 18:19.510
[United in Glory,
Building a Brilliant Campus Together]

18:19.530 --> 18:22.740
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

18:29.530 --> 18:30.500
♪ Waiting ♪

18:30.900 --> 18:35.140
♪ Enduring every second ♪

18:50.350 --> 18:53.280
[United in Glory,
Building a Brilliant Campus Together]

18:53.300 --> 18:56.960
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

19:11.740 --> 19:12.700
♪ Waiting ♪

19:13.010 --> 19:17.140
♪ Enduring every second ♪

19:35.460 --> 19:35.990
Let's go.

19:52.810 --> 19:53.610
Jin Baihui.

19:55.610 --> 19:57.700
Not everyone has a talent like yours—

19:59.380 --> 20:00.510
that kind of ability

20:02.330 --> 20:04.010
which can bring notes to life.

20:05.500 --> 20:06.940
Your parents might say no,

20:06.940 --> 20:08.600
but don't give up on yourself.

20:10.980 --> 20:12.140
Because hidden within the notes you write

20:12.140 --> 20:14.250
are the words
you're too afraid to say out loud.

20:14.250 --> 20:15.330
Your songs and your words

20:15.330 --> 20:17.330
deserve to be heard again and again.

20:18.960 --> 20:19.980
This performance

20:19.980 --> 20:22.050
is like a 10-minute break between classes—

20:22.050 --> 20:24.140
a precious 10 minutes

20:24.140 --> 20:26.250
you might not encounter
very often in life.

20:26.250 --> 20:27.530
When the break is over,

20:27.700 --> 20:29.050
we'll all return to our normal lives

20:29.050 --> 20:30.050
and schoolwork.

20:31.290 --> 20:33.020
Are you sure you want to miss out

20:33.190 --> 20:36.520
on a memory that might stay with you
for the rest of your life?

20:41.290 --> 20:42.820
The band is waiting for you.

20:56.900 --> 20:59.360
Let's go on stage together,
take that break,

20:59.530 --> 21:00.530
and then return to

21:01.250 --> 21:02.780
our normal lives together.

21:03.570 --> 21:04.250
Okay?

21:46.130 --> 21:46.860
♪ Waiting ♪

21:47.620 --> 21:51.390
♪ Every second is a test of endurance ♪

21:52.290 --> 21:53.090
♪ Run away quickly ♪

21:53.770 --> 21:57.240
♪ Testing with ulterior motives ♪

21:57.620 --> 21:59.130
♪ If I could start over ♪

22:00.360 --> 22:04.080
♪ Why not now? ♪

22:04.720 --> 22:05.450
♪ It will turn around ♪

22:06.590 --> 22:09.290
♪ Create accidents for accidents ♪

22:09.860 --> 22:12.910
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

22:13.460 --> 22:16.100
♪ This dangerous persona ♪

22:16.500 --> 22:19.090
♪ Please shut off your sense of
smell and sight ♪

22:19.310 --> 22:21.850
♪ Your hearing and touch ♪

22:22.270 --> 22:25.350
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

22:25.890 --> 22:28.450
♪ Who made the rules? ♪

22:28.840 --> 22:31.240
♪ Not loving is the most alluring thing ♪

22:31.500 --> 22:34.200
♪ It's my turn this time ♪

22:34.530 --> 22:35.330
It's the school anniversary after all.

22:35.130 --> 22:36.340
♪ Who's the one waiting? ♪

22:36.380 --> 22:37.380
The atmosphere is what matters most.

22:37.250 --> 22:41.010
♪ The hunter takes on the guise
of the prey ♪

22:37.770 --> 22:38.500
The students in our class

22:38.500 --> 22:40.560
really know how to pull off anything.

22:41.890 --> 22:42.530
♪ There's no escape ♪

22:43.360 --> 22:46.840
♪ From these familiar tactics ♪

22:47.360 --> 22:48.850
♪ It's too late to surrender ♪

22:50.020 --> 22:53.670
♪ A love that can never fall into sync ♪

22:54.170 --> 22:54.990
♪ Another twist ♪

22:56.010 --> 22:58.760
♪ We've formed a closed loop ♪

22:56.720 --> 22:58.250
Let's get this party going!

22:59.450 --> 23:02.680
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

23:02.990 --> 23:05.720
♪ This dangerous persona ♪

23:06.130 --> 23:08.690
♪ Please shut off your sense of
smell and sight ♪

23:08.920 --> 23:11.520
♪ Your hearing and touch ♪

23:11.900 --> 23:14.930
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

23:14.580 --> 23:15.690
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Full of Vigor]

23:15.410 --> 23:17.980
♪ Who made the rules? ♪

23:18.360 --> 23:20.800
♪ Not loving is the most alluring thing ♪

23:21.020 --> 23:23.250
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

23:40.270 --> 23:40.770
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Absolutely Spectacular]

24:15.110 --> 24:18.140
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

24:18.650 --> 24:21.290
♪ This dangerous persona ♪

24:21.690 --> 24:24.280
♪ Please shut off your sense of
smell and sight ♪

24:24.500 --> 24:27.040
♪ Your hearing and touch ♪

24:27.470 --> 24:30.550
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

24:31.000 --> 24:33.350
♪ Who made the rules? ♪

24:34.030 --> 24:36.430
♪ Not loving is the most alluring thing ♪

24:36.690 --> 24:39.390
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

24:40.070 --> 24:42.010
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

25:03.890 --> 25:06.100
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Shining Brightly]

25:06.380 --> 25:08.570
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Absolutely Spectacular]

25:27.780 --> 25:30.510
Why do I feel like
you're especially happy today?

25:30.590 --> 25:31.400
Of course.

25:32.150 --> 25:34.550
Duan Qiyan played the guitar beautifully,

25:35.480 --> 25:37.790
Tang Tingting's little pony was adorable,

25:37.790 --> 25:39.050
and most importantly,

25:39.240 --> 25:41.820
Jin Baihui got to step onto that stage
with everyone else.

25:41.820 --> 25:42.780
You have no idea

25:42.880 --> 25:44.480
how moving it was to see you all

25:44.480 --> 25:46.340
standing there in the spotlight.

25:48.440 --> 25:49.770
So do you feel any regret

25:50.310 --> 25:52.040
about not performing on stage?

25:53.920 --> 25:56.580
The joy of being behind the scenes
is different.

25:56.720 --> 25:59.050
Working bit by bit
to make the show happen,

25:59.350 --> 26:02.200
and then seeing you all shine on stage—

26:03.160 --> 26:05.510
that feeling is really special.

26:10.600 --> 26:11.710
Let me help you.

26:11.790 --> 26:12.550
No need.

26:37.010 --> 26:44.640
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

26:45.800 --> 26:50.020
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

26:50.410 --> 26:53.750
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

26:55.220 --> 26:58.460
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

26:59.980 --> 27:03.710
♪ How am I to understand? ♪

27:04.980 --> 27:06.020
♪ About you ♪

27:07.410 --> 27:11.630
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

27:12.420 --> 27:16.790
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

27:17.310 --> 27:20.290
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

27:20.870 --> 27:27.340
♪ The partiality towards me in your eyes ♪

27:36.400 --> 27:37.000
Chunlei.

27:37.000 --> 27:38.550
I feel like my voice is even hoarser now.

27:38.550 --> 27:40.750
I was trying so hard to hype up the crowd.

27:41.590 --> 27:43.830
I want bubble tea—

27:44.830 --> 27:45.850
the biggest size they have.

27:45.850 --> 27:46.400
Okay.

27:50.000 --> 27:50.810
Tang Tingting.

27:50.810 --> 27:52.510
Your show wasn't bad.

27:53.070 --> 27:56.070
But as the lead vocalist,
you really dropped the ball.

27:56.510 --> 27:58.110
If it weren't for Jin Baihui,

27:58.160 --> 28:00.890
your performance
would've fallen apart, right?

28:01.310 --> 28:02.310
So what?

28:02.720 --> 28:05.650
It's a fact that
Jin Baihui sings really well, right?

28:05.750 --> 28:07.410
Your show was pretty good too.

28:07.480 --> 28:08.720
After all, not every show

28:08.720 --> 28:11.320
saved time for the audience
to go to the toilet.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.160
By the way,

28:17.550 --> 28:20.070
I was chatting with some students
from Experimental High the other day,

28:20.070 --> 28:21.310
and they told me

28:21.380 --> 28:22.750
some girls from their school

28:22.750 --> 28:24.720
had been scammed by scalpers on Tieba.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.980
Someone from our school was scammed too.

28:28.070 --> 28:30.740
I think her last name was Tang.

28:32.350 --> 28:34.340
Didn't you go to that concert too?

28:34.680 --> 28:35.770
Don't tell me it was you.

28:35.770 --> 28:36.950
Of course not.

28:38.750 --> 28:39.790
That's good.

28:40.440 --> 28:43.480
I heard the tickets for that concert
were super hard to get

28:43.480 --> 28:45.200
because there were so few available
to begin with,

28:45.200 --> 28:46.730
and the perks were amazing.

28:47.350 --> 28:49.680
Everyone who went
got an autographed photo.

28:49.680 --> 28:50.860
Since you went,

28:50.960 --> 28:52.880
you must've gotten one too, right?

28:52.880 --> 28:55.470
Tingting, I'm a huge fan of Han Geng too.

28:55.750 --> 28:56.640
Could you bring the autographed photo over

28:56.640 --> 28:57.720
so I can take a look?

29:02.550 --> 29:03.810
Of course I have to keep

29:04.400 --> 29:06.880
the autographed photo safely at home.

29:07.830 --> 29:08.960
I'll bring it to school sometime

29:08.960 --> 29:10.240
and let you see it.

29:11.110 --> 29:11.920
Sure.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.440
I'll be waiting then.

29:18.920 --> 29:20.030
I have to go.

29:20.350 --> 29:22.150
We're going to celebrate later.

29:22.440 --> 29:23.240
Bye-bye.

29:24.480 --> 29:25.270
Let's go.

29:33.550 --> 29:34.310
During the performance,

29:34.310 --> 29:36.680
I thought I was watching
my idol's concert.

29:36.680 --> 29:37.550
Gosh.

29:37.550 --> 29:39.150
I felt like I was fangirling.

29:39.510 --> 29:41.030
It was super cool.

29:41.160 --> 29:42.960
Tingting, what did you say?

29:42.960 --> 29:44.270
I can't hear you.

29:51.640 --> 29:53.550
Let me ask you a question.

29:56.720 --> 29:57.140
Shoot.

29:59.440 --> 30:01.300
Didn't any of you notice my shoes?

30:02.010 --> 30:05.240
These are my new lucky shoes
I bought specially for this performance.

30:05.240 --> 30:07.780
I've been waiting all day and nobody's
asked me a single thing about them.

30:07.780 --> 30:09.860
Designer shoes, right? And?

30:10.000 --> 30:12.660
These aren't just any
ordinary designer shoes.

30:12.750 --> 30:14.090
They're the reward Duan gave me

30:14.090 --> 30:15.750
for making it into the top 5.

30:19.350 --> 30:22.010
Don't you guys think his shoes
look a little too stiff?

30:22.010 --> 30:24.210
Why don't we all just stomp on them a bit?

30:24.530 --> 30:25.420
Good idea.

30:25.750 --> 30:27.530
You guys better not mess with these.

30:27.530 --> 30:29.290
This is the latest colorway.

30:29.290 --> 30:31.420
I had my brother snag them for me

30:31.420 --> 30:33.280
at retail price from a major city.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.550
The owner of that trendy shop

30:34.550 --> 30:36.440
behind our school even

30:37.030 --> 30:38.750
marked them up to 1,000 yuan

30:38.750 --> 30:39.720
just to buy these shoes from me.

30:39.720 --> 30:41.090
I wouldn't sell them no matter what.

30:41.090 --> 30:42.640
I don't even take them off when I sleep.

30:42.640 --> 30:44.570
-Excuse me.
-On the back street...

30:44.680 --> 30:45.910
What took you guys so long?

30:45.910 --> 30:46.960
Hurry up and order some food.

30:46.960 --> 30:50.160
-See what you want to eat and drink.
-Hello, order please.

30:54.310 --> 30:55.240
This, and this.

30:56.440 --> 30:58.880
Why are there glitters on your heads?

31:00.070 --> 31:01.110
So pretty.

31:06.070 --> 31:07.370
We went to return the props,

31:07.370 --> 31:08.880
and a box in the storage room tipped over,

31:08.880 --> 31:11.270
so some glitter and ribbons
got stuck to us.

31:11.270 --> 31:12.330
Are there any left?

31:12.890 --> 31:14.480
Yes.

31:15.160 --> 31:17.830
It actually looks quite romantic.

31:46.110 --> 31:46.830
Jiang.

31:48.590 --> 31:50.480
How come your little cheeks

31:50.590 --> 31:52.310
are flushing a bit?

31:54.290 --> 31:55.740
N-No, they're not.

31:56.000 --> 31:58.160
Don't be silly. I'm just really hot.

32:00.000 --> 32:03.200
I feel like that little smile of yours
looks a bit devious.

32:05.270 --> 32:06.600
Then show me your smile.

32:07.900 --> 32:08.440
Hehe.

32:09.840 --> 32:11.840
You think your smile's pretty, huh?

32:18.220 --> 32:19.590
When it's served, I'll eat the meat,

32:19.590 --> 32:20.880
and you eat the bread.

32:20.900 --> 32:21.510
Get lost.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.720
When's your throat going to recover?

32:22.720 --> 32:24.720
If you keep talking like that,
I'm going to die laughing.

32:24.720 --> 32:26.250
Don't make fun of Tingting.

32:29.030 --> 32:29.790
Alright.

32:29.790 --> 32:31.010
Everyone's here.

32:31.270 --> 32:32.850
Let's all raise a glass

32:32.850 --> 32:34.680
to celebrate
today's successful performance.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.220
Cheers!

32:35.220 --> 32:35.810
Come on.

32:36.440 --> 32:38.030
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

32:38.640 --> 32:40.500
I'll have to stand up for this one.

32:42.740 --> 32:45.140
We ran into Zhao Shuran backstage earlier.

32:45.240 --> 32:46.810
After watching our performance,

32:46.810 --> 32:48.770
she was completely speechless.

32:49.310 --> 32:52.550
So she resorted to personal attacks
against Tingting,

32:52.720 --> 32:54.240
saying that Tingting
had only played a pony,

32:54.240 --> 32:55.750
had been scammed at a concert,

32:55.750 --> 32:56.960
and the autographed photo...

32:56.960 --> 32:58.360
Alright, that's enough.

32:58.550 --> 33:00.160
I was having such a great day.

33:00.510 --> 33:02.570
Just thinking about her makes me mad.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.600
Why should you be mad?

33:05.310 --> 33:06.400
Our little pony

33:06.400 --> 33:08.400
did a great job today.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.480
You have no idea.

33:11.590 --> 33:13.120
When you appeared on stage,

33:13.990 --> 33:16.960
you took the whole atmosphere
to another level.

33:17.310 --> 33:19.540
You've officially inherited my legacy.

33:19.540 --> 33:21.480
Thank you, Tang.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.270
Yeah, you did a great job.

33:26.070 --> 33:28.270
And Jin Baihui, you sang really well.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.960
I heard many students in the audience

33:30.960 --> 33:33.440
saying they were going to download
this song and listen to it at home.

33:33.440 --> 33:34.160
Yeah.

33:34.330 --> 33:35.930
You should write more songs.

33:37.110 --> 33:38.090
Exactly.

33:38.750 --> 33:39.750
In that case,

33:40.000 --> 33:41.720
our band will be able to debut!

33:42.180 --> 33:44.310
I'll pass.

33:44.900 --> 33:47.460
I was just letting myself be rebellious
for once on stage today.

33:47.460 --> 33:48.700
If my dad finds out,

33:50.350 --> 33:52.480
I'm going to be in for it when I get home.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.290
I understand what you mean.

33:55.290 --> 33:57.150
You'd better stop writing songs.

33:57.610 --> 33:58.830
Shen, do you remember

33:58.830 --> 34:00.830
though we only met her dad
for the first time today,

34:00.830 --> 34:02.690
he came in right away scolding us?

34:02.940 --> 34:04.180
If you write another song,

34:04.180 --> 34:05.090
I bet we'd both

34:05.090 --> 34:06.460
be accused of instigation.

34:06.460 --> 34:07.510
Look how cowardly he is.

34:07.510 --> 34:09.170
I'm not the coward here. He is.

34:09.360 --> 34:10.820
You're the coward.

34:12.150 --> 34:13.880
If it weren't for your song,

34:14.420 --> 34:17.820
our band wouldn't have put on
such a successful performance.

34:19.020 --> 34:20.940
And your song's really catchy.

34:21.600 --> 34:23.429
Every night when I close my eyes

34:23.800 --> 34:25.000
to sleep,

34:25.440 --> 34:27.880
your melodies just
keep playing in my head.

34:58.130 --> 34:58.880
Well,

34:59.630 --> 35:01.560
it's getting late. I'll get going.

35:02.320 --> 35:03.720
You're leaving already?

35:04.400 --> 35:05.590
So early?

35:08.590 --> 35:09.230
Your bag.

35:10.710 --> 35:11.510
-I'll walk you out.
-Bye-bye.

35:11.510 --> 35:12.020
Bye-bye.

35:12.020 --> 35:12.480
Bye-bye.

35:12.480 --> 35:12.950
Bye-bye.

35:12.950 --> 35:14.840
-Bye-bye.
-Be careful on your way back.

35:14.840 --> 35:15.370
Bye-bye.

35:20.420 --> 35:21.130
Jin Baihui,

35:28.320 --> 35:29.820
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

35:34.110 --> 35:35.960
I've wanted to give this to you

35:35.960 --> 35:38.020
ever since we first started the band.

35:40.110 --> 35:41.070
Hope you like it.

35:44.030 --> 35:44.920
Lin Zhixia.

35:49.010 --> 35:51.690
Thank you for letting me be brave
this once.

35:52.150 --> 35:53.150
I don't regret it.

35:55.710 --> 35:57.240
You should thank yourself.

35:57.480 --> 35:59.280
It was your choice to go on stage.

36:03.320 --> 36:05.150
But now that the break's over,

36:05.520 --> 36:08.850
I have to go back to facing
the same old routine day after day.

36:10.320 --> 36:13.050
Maybe life itself
is your source of inspiration.

36:14.510 --> 36:16.360
It's because you've experienced pain

36:16.360 --> 36:18.420
that your lyrics carry so much power.

36:21.960 --> 36:24.070
Actually, I revised those lyrics
several times.

36:24.070 --> 36:26.730
The original version
even had swear words in it.

36:29.880 --> 36:32.810
Thank you for not singing
the original version then.

36:34.920 --> 36:36.120
I'm heading back now.

36:36.280 --> 36:38.480
If I can't finish those papers tonight,

36:38.650 --> 36:40.850
I probably won't be able to sleep again.

36:42.280 --> 36:43.540
Good luck, Jin Baihui.

36:46.110 --> 36:46.710
Thank you.

36:58.020 --> 36:58.610
[Everyday To-do List]

36:58.630 --> 36:59.230
[Math: 30 Olympiad Problems]

36:59.250 --> 36:59.980
[Physics: 15 Challenging Problems]

37:00.010 --> 37:00.640
[Chemistry: 20 Calculation Problems]

37:00.670 --> 37:01.370
[English: Memorize 2 Passages
+50 Vocabulary Words]

37:35.350 --> 37:39.320
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

37:41.530 --> 37:48.250
[Everything has cracks;
that's where the light gets in.]

37:53.640 --> 37:56.780
[The loneliness you feel now
is like a rainy day.]

37:56.800 --> 38:01.530
[It will pass. When the skies clear,]

38:01.550 --> 38:10.120
[you'll be able to go bask in the sun
with your friends again.]
